  "design_notes": [
    "Dependencies can reference logical fact keys so new evidence versions do not orphan dependency edges.",
    "Decision records bind exact evidence versions and policy version.",
    "Authorization binds evidence versions, policy version, and action parameter hash.",
    "The gateway repeats safety checks immediately before simulated external commit.",
    "Execution uses Idempotency-Key to prevent duplicate simulated side effects.",
    "The simulator is not a distributed transaction; production adapters require outbox/reconciliation semantics."
  ]
}